00:09:14.160 --> 00:09:15.870
So what is Darwin,
and what is it

00:09:15.870 --> 00:09:18.090
in the context of
the industrial space,

00:09:18.090 --> 00:09:19.370
and especially in oil and gas?

00:09:19.370 --> 00:09:21.786
So I'm going to go through a
little bit about how it works

00:09:21.786 --> 00:09:23.550
and what's happening
behind the scenes.

00:09:23.550 --> 00:09:26.920
And then we'll get into
